62,"line":361},"type":41,"typeText":"∀ {α : Type u_1} {s t : Multiset.{u_1} α},\n  Multiset.Nodup.{u_1} s →\n    Multiset.Nodup.{u_1} t →\n      Iff (Eq.{u_1 + 1} s t) (∀ (a : α), Iff (Membership.mem.{u_1, u_1} s a) (Membership.mem.{u_1, u_1} t a))","unsafe":false,"value":152,"source":{"code":"theorem Nodup.ext {s t : Multiset α} : Nodup s → Nodup t → (s = t ↔ ∀ a, a ∈ s ↔ a ∈ t) :=\n  Quotient.inductionOn₂ s t fun _ _ d₁ d₂ => Quotient.eq.trans <| perm_ext_iff_of_nodup d₁ d₂","start":361,"end":362},"axioms":["Quot.sound","propext"]}